  "content": "\n\n<h1>磁力附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmagnetic-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/magnetic-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/lullaby-enchantments-data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/lullaby-enchantments-data-packs\" alt=\"授權\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>📖 說明</h2>\n<p>為工具與武器新增的附魔，可自動拾取挖掘出的方塊或掉落物！</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易取得。</p>\n<p>相容於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsmelting-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">熔煉</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-veinminer-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">礦脈採掘</a> 附魔！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 不相容項目</h2>\n<p>不與以下模組相容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂消失計時器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot magnetic_enchantment:magnetic</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s magnetic_enchantment:magnetic</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/lullaby-enchantments-data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤／問題回報</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcD